{"fps": 30, "frames": 15177, "shots": [{"id": "s01_attic", "ch": 1, "start": 0, "end": 218, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "London. August, sixteen sixty-five. Three in the morning.", "start": 18, "end": 147, "t0": 0.6, "t1": 4.906}, {"sp": "N", "text": "You haven't slept for two nights.", "start": 157, "end": 213, "t0": 5.226, "t1": 7.095}]}, {"id": "s02_window", "ch": 1, "start": 218, "end": 379, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Outside, a bell is ringing for the dead. Half the city is running from the plague.", "start": 218, "end": 374, "t0": 7.267, "t1": 12.469}]}, {"id": "s03_situp", "ch": 1, "start": 379, "end": 577, "lines": [{"sp": "TOM", "text": "Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow.", "start": 388, "end": 440, "t0": 12.933, "t1": 14.676, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.176], ["X", 0.571], ["X", 0.815], ["A", 0.924], ["A", 0.986], ["A", 0.911], ["S", 0.72], ["S", 0.759], ["S", 0.659], ["S", 0.891], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.97], ["O", 0.834], ["O", 0.638], ["O", 0.435], ["O", 0.202], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.219], ["A", 0.512], ["A", 0.614], ["O", 0.585], ["O", 0.529], ["O", 0.462], ["O", 0.375], ["O", 0.228], ["O", 0.102], ["O", 0.117], ["O", 0.304], ["A", 0.493], ["A", 0.547], ["O", 0.513], ["O", 0.439], ["O", 0.382], ["O", 0.352], ["O", 0.323], ["O", 0.188], ["O", 0.116], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "And you... have a toothache.", "start": 446, "end": 499, "t0": 14.876, "t1": 16.641}]}, {"id": "s04_promise", "ch": 1, "start": 577, "end": 856, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Over the next three days, you will try everything London has to offer.", "start": 577, "end": 711, "t0": 19.233, "t1": 23.709}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Every cure will be worse than the last. And one of them could kill you.", "start": 721, "end": 851, "t0": 24.029, "t1": 28.354}]}, {"id": "s05_title", "ch": 1, "start": 856, "end": 987, "lines": []}, {"id": "s06_map", "ch": 2, "start": 987, "end": 1244, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "You are Tom. Fifteen years old, and two years into a seven-year apprenticeship with a baker, inside the old city walls.", "start": 987, "end": 1239, "t0": 32.9, "t1": 41.286}]}, {"id": "s07_bakery", "ch": 2, "start": 1244, "end": 1519, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Your day starts at four, in the heat of the oven. Whatever happens, London still needs bread.", "start": 1244, "end": 1433, "t0": 41.467, "t1": 47.767}, {"sp": "HOLLIS", "text": "Faster, boy! Bread doesn't bake itself!", "start": 1443, "end": 1513, "t0": 48.087, "t1": 50.439, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.117], ["S", 0.353], ["A", 0.844], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.952], ["A", 0.759], ["S", 0.53], ["S", 0.33], ["S", 0.152], ["S", 0.29], ["A", 0.708], ["A", 0.833], ["O", 0.669], ["O", 0.481], ["O", 0.327], ["O", 0.357], ["O", 0.782], ["O", 0.981], ["O", 0.986], ["O", 0.956], ["O", 0.933], ["O", 0.841], ["A", 0.675], ["A", 0.519], ["A", 0.464], ["A", 0.41], ["O", 0.296], ["O", 0.178], ["O", 0.263], ["O", 0.754], ["A", 0.969], ["A", 0.946], ["A", 0.821], ["O", 0.557], ["O", 0.357], ["O", 0.269], ["O", 0.464], ["A", 0.819], ["A", 0.768], ["S", 0.575], ["S", 0.615], ["S", 0.843], ["S", 0.731], ["O", 0.467], ["O", 0.28], ["O", 0.291], ["A", 0.695], ["A", 0.876], ["A", 0.82], ["A", 0.522], ["A", 0.226], ["A", 0.263], ["A", 0.492], ["A", 0.294], ["A", 0.121], ["S", 0.171], ["S", 0.253], ["S", 0.323], ["S", 0.592], ["A", 0.887], ["A", 0.838], ["A", 0.607], ["A", 0.412], ["A", 0.28], ["A", 0.187], ["A", 0.123], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s07b_apprentice", "ch": 2, "start": 1519, "end": 1860, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "As an apprentice, you are not paid. You get a bed under the roof, your meals, and the right to be shouted at.", "start": 1519, "end": 1726, "t0": 50.633, "t1": 57.542}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Survive seven years, and you could become a baker yourself.", "start": 1736, "end": 1854, "t0": 57.862, "t1": 61.809}]}, {"id": "s08_crust", "ch": 2, "start": 1860, "end": 2093, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Your trouble began with a crust. One bite, on the left side,", "start": 1860, "end": 1983, "t0": 62.0, "t1": 66.115}, {"sp": "N", "text": "and a bolt of pain shot straight up into your eye.", "start": 1989, "end": 2088, "t0": 66.315, "t1": 69.603}]}, {"id": "s09_flinch", "ch": 2, "start": 2093, "end": 2201, "lines": [{"sp": "TOM", "text": "Aaagh!", "start": 2093, "end": 2115, "t0": 69.767, "t1": 70.507, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.161], ["A", 0.429], ["A", 0.74], ["A", 0.952], ["A", 0.995], ["O", 0.947], ["O", 0.821], ["O", 0.725], ["O", 0.694], ["O", 0.659], ["O", 0.569], ["O", 0.386], ["O", 0.173], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.101], ["O", 0.106], ["O", 0.127], ["O", 0.149], ["O", 0.112], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "HOLLIS", "text": "Quiet! You'll wake the whole street.", "start": 2125, "end": 2183, "t0": 70.827, "t1": 72.781, "vis": [["A", 0.193], ["A", 0.398], ["O", 0.85], ["O", 1.0], ["A", 0.998], ["A", 0.98], ["A", 0.926], ["A", 0.854], ["A", 0.778], ["A", 0.65], ["A", 0.516], ["A", 0.344], ["A", 0.175], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.201], ["A", 0.632], ["A", 0.894], ["O", 0.881], ["O", 0.756], ["O", 0.711], ["O", 0.903], ["A", 0.916], ["A", 0.811], ["A", 0.609], ["A", 0.287], ["A", 0.138], ["S", 0.103], ["S", 0.183], ["A", 0.517], ["A", 0.572], ["A", 0.455], ["A", 0.45], ["A", 0.73], ["A", 0.817], ["O", 0.728], ["O", 0.688], ["O", 0.631], ["O", 0.455], ["S", 0.316], ["S", 0.282], ["S", 0.258], ["S", 0.162], ["S", 0.199], ["S", 0.461], ["O", 0.872], ["O", 0.97], ["A", 0.858], ["A", 0.598], ["A", 0.349], ["A", 0.2], ["A", 0.141], ["S", 0.159], ["S", 0.153], ["S", 0.114], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s10_street", "ch": 2, "start": 2201, "end": 2498, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "And this is a very bad summer to be ill.", "start": 2201, "end": 2291, "t0": 73.367, "t1": 76.374}, {"sp": "N", "text": "When plague is found in a house, the house is shut up for forty days, with everyone still inside.", "start": 2301, "end": 2492, "t0": 76.694, "t1": 83.072}]}, {"id": "s11_door", "ch": 2, "start": 2498, "end": 2805, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "A red cross is painted on the door, with the words: Lord have mercy upon us.", "start": 2498, "end": 2653, "t0": 83.267, "t1": 88.44}, {"sp": "N", "text": "A watchman stands outside, day and night, to make sure nobody leaves.", "start": 2663, "end": 2800, "t0": 88.76, "t1": 93.32}]}, {"id": "s11b_cart", "ch": 2, "start": 2805, "end": 3075, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "By August, thousands of Londoners are dying every week, and the numbers are still climbing. The king and his court have already left town.", "start": 2805, "end": 3070, "t0": 93.5, "t1": 102.318}]}, {"id": "s12_bill", "ch": 2, "start": 3075, "end": 3463, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Every week, the parish clerks print a Bill of Mortality: who died, and of what.", "start": 3075, "end": 3238, "t0": 102.5, "t1": 107.924}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Run your finger down the list. Plague. Fever. Consumption. And then, a word you really don't want to see.", "start": 3247, "end": 3457, "t0": 108.243, "t1": 115.241}]}, {"id": "s13_teeth", "ch": 2, "start": 3463, "end": 3590, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Teeth.", "start": 3472, "end": 3493, "t0": 115.733, "t1": 116.419}, {"sp": "TOM", "text": "...Teeth?", "start": 3523, "end": 3548, "t0": 117.419, "t1": 118.279, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["O", 0.113], ["O", 0.134], ["O", 0.281], ["S", 0.572], ["S", 0.54], ["A", 0.85], ["A", 0.996], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.939], ["O", 0.721], ["O", 0.54], ["O", 0.41], ["O", 0.227], ["O", 0.113], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["O", 0.105], ["O", 0.113], ["O", 0.124], ["O", 0.115], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s14_worm", "ch": 3, "start": 3590, "end": 3979, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Ask anyone what's wrong with you, and they'll give you the same answer. A worm.", "start": 3590, "end": 3744, "t0": 119.667, "t1": 124.812}, {"sp": "N", "text": "For thousands of years, people believed toothache was caused by a tiny worm, boring holes through your tooth.", "start": 3754, "end": 3974, "t0": 125.132, "t1": 132.459}]}, {"id": "s15_truth", "ch": 3, "start": 3979, "end": 4300, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "There is no worm. A cavity has eaten down to the nerve, and bacteria are building a pocket of pus at the root.", "start": 3979, "end": 4203, "t0": 132.633, "t1": 140.11}, {"sp": "N", "text": "That's the swelling. And it is getting bigger.", "start": 4213, "end": 4295, "t0": 140.43, "t1": 143.169}]}, {"id": "s16_why", "ch": 3, "start": 4300, "end": 4797, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Your teeth never had much of a chance. Bread from stone mills carried grit that wore them down,", "start": 4300, "end": 4492, "t0": 143.333, "t1": 149.732}, {"sp": "N", "text": "and sugar, once a rich man's treat, was getting cheaper every year. And toothbrushes, as we know them, won't reach England for another century.", "start": 4502, "end": 4792, "t0": 150.052, "t1": 159.723}]}, {"id": "s17_agnes", "ch": 4, "start": 4797, "end": 5020, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Luckily, your master's wife has a cure for everything.", "start": 4797, "end": 4911, "t0": 159.9, "t1": 163.704}, {"sp": "AGNES", "text": "Let me see that face. Oh, Tom. That's a worm, that is.", "start": 4921, "end": 5015, "t0": 164.024, "t1": 167.151, "vis": [["S", 0.167], ["E", 0.601], ["E", 0.929], ["E", 0.868], ["E", 0.502], ["A", 0.554], ["A", 0.863], ["A", 0.876], ["S", 0.57], ["S", 0.452], ["S", 0.471], ["S", 0.574], ["E", 0.764], ["E", 0.665], ["E", 0.457], ["E", 0.795], ["E", 0.876], ["E", 0.519], ["E", 0.153], ["S", 0.122], ["S", 0.132], ["S", 0.229], ["S", 0.639], ["E", 0.934], ["E", 0.958], ["E", 0.851], ["E", 0.642], ["E", 0.396], ["E", 0.204], ["S", 0.158], ["S", 0.253], ["S", 0.327], ["S", 0.29], ["S", 0.188], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.134], ["S", 0.595], ["E", 0.932], ["E", 1.0], ["A", 0.925], ["A", 0.584], ["A", 0.291], ["S", 0.455], ["S", 0.36], ["S", 0.615], ["A", 0.897], ["A", 0.917], ["A", 0.775], ["A", 0.676], ["A", 0.646], ["A", 0.596], ["A", 0.6], ["E", 0.782], ["E", 0.505], ["S", 0.207], ["S", 0.334], ["S", 0.422], ["S", 0.548], ["O", 0.45], ["O", 0.474], ["A", 0.786], ["A", 0.97], ["E", 0.982], ["E", 0.884], ["E", 0.713], ["A", 0.59], ["A", 0.507], ["E", 0.453], ["E", 0.563], ["E", 0.56], ["E", 0.325], ["S", 0.177], ["S", 0.293], ["S", 0.414], ["E", 0.614], ["E", 0.737], ["E", 0.765], ["E", 0.674], ["E", 0.446], ["S", 0.273], ["S", 0.302], ["S", 0.298], ["S", 0.236], ["S", 0.139], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s18_recipes", "ch": 4, "start": 5020, "end": 5212, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Households kept handwritten recipe books full of remedies, and toothache filled whole pages.", "start": 5020, "end": 5206, "t0": 167.333, "t1": 173.546}]}, {"id": "s19_clove", "ch": 4, "start": 5212, "end": 5602, "lines": [{"sp": "AGNES", "text": "Oil of cloves. Hold it on the tooth.", "start": 5212, "end": 5270, "t0": 173.733, "t1": 175.662, "vis": [["A", 0.436], ["A", 0.784], ["A", 0.959], ["A", 0.998], ["E", 0.968], ["E", 0.855], ["E", 0.79], ["E", 0.692], ["S", 0.317], ["S", 0.105], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.32], ["E", 0.53], ["E", 0.826], ["E", 0.978], ["E", 0.979], ["E", 0.901], ["E", 0.792], ["E", 0.624], ["E", 0.497], ["E", 0.372], ["E", 0.199], ["S", 0.189], ["S", 0.377], ["S", 0.419], ["S", 0.205], ["S", 0.142], ["S", 0.244], ["S", 0.522], ["A", 0.865], ["A", 0.859], ["A", 0.726], ["A", 0.573], ["A", 0.39], ["E", 0.482], ["E", 0.442], ["S", 0.387], ["S", 0.409], ["A", 0.507], ["A", 0.527], ["A", 0.519], ["A", 0.485], ["A", 0.381], ["S", 0.187], ["S", 0.32], ["S", 0.485], ["S", 0.396], ["E", 0.532], ["E", 0.529], ["E", 0.409], ["E", 0.284], ["E", 0.147], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Cure number one. Clove oil is expensive, and it burns.", "start": 5279, "end": 5398, "t0": 175.982, "t1": 179.934}, {"sp": "N", "text": "But for once, it actually helps. Cloves contain a natural painkiller that numbs the gum.", "start": 5408, "end": 5596, "t0": 180.254, "t1": 186.537}]}, {"id": "s20_happy", "ch": 4, "start": 5602, "end": 5833, "lines": [{"sp": "TOM", "text": "I can't feel my face!", "start": 5602, "end": 5660, "t0": 186.733, "t1": 188.673, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.22], ["A", 0.717], ["A", 0.892], ["O", 0.586], ["O", 0.282], ["E", 0.49], ["E", 0.72], ["A", 0.936], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.882], ["A", 0.474], ["A", 0.184], ["S", 0.114], ["S", 0.256], ["S", 0.731], ["S", 0.959], ["O", 0.928], ["O", 0.826], ["O", 0.779], ["O", 0.776], ["O", 0.766], ["O", 0.787], ["O", 0.729], ["O", 0.663], ["O", 0.453], ["O", 0.175], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.226], ["A", 0.666], ["A", 0.899], ["A", 0.817], ["A", 0.665], ["O", 0.519], ["O", 0.352], ["O", 0.254], ["S", 0.455], ["S", 0.71], ["S", 0.727], ["S", 0.627], ["S", 0.395], ["S", 0.164], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "For about an hour, you're a new man.", "start": 5670, "end": 5740, "t0": 188.993, "t1": 191.332}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Then it wears off.", "start": 5758, "end": 5798, "t0": 191.932, "t1": 193.261}]}, {"id": "s20b_back", "ch": 4, "start": 5833, "end": 6039, "lines": [{"sp": "HOLLIS", "text": "Stop moaning and knead, boy!", "start": 5833, "end": 5892, "t0": 194.433, "t1": 196.395, "vis": [["S", 0.222], ["S", 0.397], ["S", 0.359], ["S", 0.206], ["S", 0.479], ["A", 0.875], ["A", 0.799], ["A", 0.325], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.2], ["O", 0.703], ["O", 0.965], ["A", 0.995], ["A", 0.968], ["A", 0.926], ["A", 0.922], ["O", 0.917], ["O", 0.847], ["A", 0.756], ["A", 0.667], ["A", 0.606], ["A", 0.502], ["A", 0.381], ["A", 0.425], ["O", 0.596], ["O", 0.698], ["O", 0.722], ["O", 0.786], ["O", 0.899], ["O", 0.963], ["A", 0.967], ["A", 0.885], ["A", 0.81], ["A", 0.738], ["A", 0.631], ["E", 0.535], ["E", 0.444], ["E", 0.343], ["E", 0.263], ["E", 0.218], ["E", 0.174], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.266], ["O", 0.817], ["O", 0.967], ["O", 0.893], ["O", 0.837], ["O", 0.784], ["A", 0.613], ["A", 0.422], ["E", 0.29], ["E", 0.236], ["E", 0.188], ["E", 0.133], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "TOM", "text": "Yes, master.", "start": 5901, "end": 5939, "t0": 196.715, "t1": 197.954, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["O", 0.176], ["O", 0.448], ["A", 0.818], ["A", 0.979], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.907], ["A", 0.628], ["S", 0.572], ["S", 0.635], ["S", 0.457], ["O", 0.324], ["O", 0.637], ["O", 0.831], ["O", 0.949], ["A", 0.933], ["A", 0.803], ["A", 0.597], ["A", 0.323], ["S", 0.187], ["S", 0.261], ["S", 0.306], ["S", 0.222], ["S", 0.109], ["S", 0.128], ["O", 0.257], ["O", 0.274], ["O", 0.264], ["O", 0.207], ["O", 0.118], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "And the pain comes back, worse than before.", "start": 5948, "end": 6034, "t0": 198.274, "t1": 201.129}]}, {"id": "s21_root", "ch": 4, "start": 6039, "end": 6425, "lines": [{"sp": "AGNES", "text": "Then chew this. Pellitory of Spain.", "start": 6039, "end": 6097, "t0": 201.3, "t1": 203.229, "vis": [["O", 0.198], ["E", 0.56], ["E", 0.91], ["E", 0.992], ["A", 0.976], ["A", 0.906], ["A", 0.642], ["S", 0.563], ["S", 0.626], ["S", 0.445], ["E", 0.643], ["E", 0.795], ["E", 0.761], ["E", 0.543], ["E", 0.536], ["E", 0.857], ["E", 0.803], ["E", 0.409], ["S", 0.213], ["S", 0.291], ["S", 0.323], ["S", 0.275], ["S", 0.148], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.161], ["S", 0.434], ["S", 0.815], ["S", 0.94], ["E", 0.88], ["E", 0.858], ["E", 0.523], ["S", 0.277], ["S", 0.364], ["S", 0.364], ["A", 0.551], ["A", 0.648], ["E", 0.654], ["E", 0.756], ["E", 0.623], ["S", 0.315], ["S", 0.393], ["S", 0.411], ["S", 0.22], ["S", 0.209], ["S", 0.67], ["E", 0.852], ["E", 0.79], ["E", 0.674], ["E", 0.575], ["E", 0.519], ["E", 0.47], ["E", 0.437], ["E", 0.396], ["E", 0.338], ["E", 0.238], ["E", 0.116], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Cure number two. A hot, peppery root. You chew it until your mouth tingles, goes numb,", "start": 6106, "end": 6276, "t0": 203.549, "t1": 209.194}, {"sp": "N", "text": "and floods with spit. Healers had praised it for toothache for centuries.", "start": 6285, "end": 6420, "t0": 209.514, "t1": 213.994}]}, {"id": "s22_drool", "ch": 4, "start": 6425, "end": 6550, "lines": [{"sp": "TOM", "text": "Ith it thuppothed to do thith?", "start": 6425, "end": 6486, "t0": 214.167, "t1": 216.206, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.22], ["A", 0.716], ["A", 0.946], ["A", 0.766], ["S", 0.287], ["S", 0.295], ["A", 0.822], ["A", 0.919], ["O", 0.575], ["O", 0.264], ["S", 0.489], ["S", 0.814], ["S", 0.599], ["S", 0.348], ["A", 0.692], ["A", 0.957], ["A", 0.843], ["O", 0.354], ["O", 0.231], ["O", 0.54], ["O", 0.779], ["O", 0.677], ["O", 0.364], ["S", 0.188], ["S", 0.117], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.144], ["S", 0.291], ["S", 0.304], ["O", 0.332], ["O", 0.323], ["O", 0.462], ["O", 0.565], ["O", 0.547], ["O", 0.428], ["A", 0.429], ["A", 0.665], ["A", 0.681], ["A", 0.552], ["A", 0.38], ["A", 0.206], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "AGNES", "text": "Yes.", "start": 6496, "end": 6520, "t0": 216.526, "t1": 217.337, "vis": [["E", 0.278], ["E", 0.513], ["E", 0.682], ["E", 0.923], ["E", 1.0], ["E", 0.978], ["E", 0.897], ["E", 0.788], ["E", 0.611], ["E", 0.374], ["S", 0.215], ["S", 0.254], ["S", 0.293], ["S", 0.266], ["S", 0.166], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s23_henbane", "ch": 4, "start": 6550, "end": 6870, "lines": [{"sp": "AGNES", "text": "Right. Now we smoke the worm out.", "start": 6550, "end": 6606, "t0": 218.333, "t1": 220.187, "vis": [["A", 0.225], ["A", 0.497], ["E", 0.883], ["E", 1.0], ["E", 1.0], ["E", 0.976], ["E", 0.828], ["E", 0.51], ["E", 0.248], ["S", 0.264], ["S", 0.331], ["S", 0.379], ["S", 0.67], ["E", 0.807], ["E", 0.83], ["E", 0.854], ["E", 0.876], ["A", 0.816], ["A", 0.609], ["A", 0.483], ["A", 0.565], ["S", 0.491], ["S", 0.636], ["S", 0.641], ["S", 0.496], ["S", 0.731], ["E", 0.858], ["E", 0.882], ["E", 0.831], ["E", 0.448], ["E", 0.141], ["S", 0.123], ["S", 0.139], ["S", 0.319], ["S", 0.449], ["S", 0.389], ["A", 0.596], ["A", 0.872], ["E", 0.813], ["E", 0.688], ["E", 0.595], ["A", 0.551], ["A", 0.515], ["E", 0.517], ["E", 0.505], ["E", 0.463], ["E", 0.424], ["E", 0.355], ["E", 0.265], ["E", 0.151], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.219], ["S", 0.338], ["S", 0.219], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Cure number three. Henbane seeds, burned over a candle, the smoke funnelled into your mouth, so the worm comes crawling out.", "start": 6615, "end": 6865, "t0": 220.507, "t1": 228.824}]}, {"id": "s24_trick", "ch": 4, "start": 6870, "end": 7179, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Some tooth-drawers even dropped little white threads into a bowl of water afterwards. Look, worms!", "start": 6870, "end": 7072, "t0": 229.0, "t1": 235.727}, {"sp": "N", "text": "It was a trick, as old as the worm itself.", "start": 7081, "end": 7173, "t0": 236.047, "t1": 239.105}]}, {"id": "s25_dizzy", "ch": 4, "start": 7179, "end": 7600, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "And henbane is poisonous. Too much smoke brings dizziness, a racing heart, even visions.", "start": 7179, "end": 7367, "t0": 239.3, "t1": 245.571}, {"sp": "N", "text": "It can't kill a worm that doesn't exist. But it can certainly poison you.", "start": 7377, "end": 7515, "t0": 245.891, "t1": 250.514}, {"sp": "TOM", "text": "Why are there two of you?", "start": 7525, "end": 7577, "t0": 250.834, "t1": 252.554, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["O", 0.268], ["O", 0.659], ["A", 0.939], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.978], ["A", 0.914], ["A", 0.85], ["A", 0.617], ["A", 0.345], ["A", 0.493], ["A", 0.593], ["A", 0.521], ["A", 0.321], ["A", 0.257], ["S", 0.692], ["S", 0.83], ["S", 0.504], ["S", 0.485], ["O", 0.584], ["O", 0.568], ["O", 0.528], ["O", 0.427], ["O", 0.237], ["S", 0.105], ["S", 0.111], ["O", 0.23], ["O", 0.299], ["O", 0.294], ["O", 0.275], ["O", 0.238], ["O", 0.178], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s26_night3", "ch": 4, "start": 7600, "end": 7868, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "By the third night, your cheek is swollen like a bread roll. You're shivering, and you know what has to happen.", "start": 7600, "end": 7795, "t0": 253.333, "t1": 259.828}, {"sp": "N", "text": "The tooth has to come out.", "start": 7804, "end": 7863, "t0": 260.148, "t1": 262.097}]}, {"id": "s27_options", "ch": 5, "start": 7868, "end": 8306, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "But who pulls teeth in sixteen sixty-five? In a normal year, you'd find a tooth-drawer at a fair, pulling teeth on a stage, with a drum to cover the screaming.", "start": 7868, "end": 8181, "t0": 262.267, "t1": 272.685}, {"sp": "N", "text": "This summer, a crowd is the last place you want to be.", "start": 8190, "end": 8301, "t0": 273.005, "t1": 276.698}]}, {"id": "s28_physician", "ch": 5, "start": 8306, "end": 8605, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "A university physician would cost far more than you earn. And many of them have already left the city, following their rich patients to the countryside.", "start": 8306, "end": 8599, "t0": 276.867, "t1": 286.639}]}, {"id": "s29_barberopt", "ch": 5, "start": 8605, "end": 8815, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Which leaves the barber-surgeon. The same man who shaves your master, lets his blood, and pulls his teeth.", "start": 8605, "end": 8809, "t0": 286.833, "t1": 293.647}]}, {"id": "s30_route", "ch": 5, "start": 8815, "end": 8953, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "So at first light, you walk across a city that is slowly emptying.", "start": 8815, "end": 8948, "t0": 293.833, "t1": 298.255}]}, {"id": "s31_nightstreet", "ch": 5, "start": 8953, "end": 9330, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Past shut-up doors. Past the cart that only comes out at night.", "start": 8953, "end": 9079, "t0": 298.433, "t1": 302.629}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Past people pressing vinegar-soaked sponges to their faces, because everyone knows that disease travels on bad air.", "start": 9088, "end": 9324, "t0": 302.949, "t1": 310.816}]}, {"id": "s32_tobacco", "ch": 5, "start": 9330, "end": 9642, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Some swore by tobacco smoke. At Eton school, according to a later account, boys were even whipped for not smoking.", "start": 9330, "end": 9571, "t0": 311.0, "t1": 319.024}]}, {"id": "s33_shopfront", "ch": 6, "start": 9642, "end": 9871, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "The barber-surgeon's shop is easy to find. He hangs the teeth he's pulled in the window.", "start": 9642, "end": 9811, "t0": 321.4, "t1": 327.027}, {"sp": "N", "text": "It's an advertisement.", "start": 9820, "end": 9866, "t0": 327.347, "t1": 328.857}]}, {"id": "s34_greet", "ch": 6, "start": 9871, "end": 10151, "lines": [{"sp": "BARBER", "text": "Toothache, is it? Sit down, lad. Sit.", "start": 9871, "end": 9959, "t0": 329.033, "t1": 331.966, "vis": [["S", 0.199], ["S", 0.458], ["A", 0.872], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.937], ["A", 0.671], ["S", 0.336], ["S", 0.167], ["S", 0.309], ["A", 0.758], ["A", 0.926], ["A", 0.769], ["A", 0.559], ["E", 0.344], ["E", 0.14], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.148], ["X", 0.346], ["X", 0.519], ["X", 0.47], ["S", 0.285], ["S", 0.235], ["S", 0.326], ["E", 0.297], ["E", 0.149], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.196], ["S", 0.431], ["S", 0.802], ["A", 0.949], ["A", 0.737], ["O", 0.255], ["O", 0.102], ["O", 0.187], ["O", 0.543], ["A", 0.908], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.983], ["A", 0.903], ["A", 0.77], ["O", 0.625], ["O", 0.533], ["O", 0.451], ["O", 0.393], ["O", 0.377], ["O", 0.396], ["A", 0.522], ["A", 0.636], ["A", 0.641], ["A", 0.502], ["A", 0.372], ["A", 0.285], ["A", 0.206], ["A", 0.171], ["A", 0.145], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.193], ["S", 0.296], ["S", 0.425], ["S", 0.714], ["E", 0.652], ["E", 0.359], ["E", 0.136], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "A chair. A basin. A candle. And a row of tools you try very hard not to look at.", "start": 9971, "end": 10146, "t0": 332.366, "t1": 338.185}]}, {"id": "s35_tools", "ch": 6, "start": 10151, "end": 10512, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Iron forceps. A hooked lever called a pelican, named for the bird's beak. No anaesthetic. Nothing to numb you.", "start": 10151, "end": 10375, "t0": 338.367, "t1": 345.846}, {"sp": "N", "text": "At best, a cup of strong drink, and somebody holding your head.", "start": 10385, "end": 10507, "t0": 346.166, "t1": 350.219}]}, {"id": "s35b_company", "ch": 6, "start": 10512, "end": 10859, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Barber-surgeons had their own company, with a grand hall in the city, where they were allowed to cut open the bodies of hanged criminals, to learn anatomy.", "start": 10512, "end": 10813, "t0": 350.4, "t1": 360.438}, {"sp": "TOM", "text": "...Lovely.", "start": 10823, "end": 10854, "t0": 360.758, "t1": 361.788, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.113], ["S", 0.144], ["S", 0.146], ["S", 0.222], ["O", 0.372], ["O", 0.589], ["O", 0.81], ["A", 0.964], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.956], ["A", 0.702], ["S", 0.285], ["S", 0.163], ["S", 0.215], ["O", 0.324], ["O", 0.373], ["O", 0.349], ["O", 0.328], ["O", 0.25], ["O", 0.116], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s36_drink", "ch": 6, "start": 10859, "end": 11037, "lines": [{"sp": "BARBER", "text": "Drink this. All of it.", "start": 10859, "end": 10907, "t0": 361.967, "t1": 363.558, "vis": [["O", 0.126], ["O", 0.224], ["S", 0.376], ["S", 0.651], ["A", 0.927], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.999], ["A", 0.996], ["O", 0.935], ["O", 0.641], ["O", 0.26], ["O", 0.114], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.241], ["E", 0.443], ["E", 0.483], ["E", 0.33], ["E", 0.192], ["S", 0.153], ["S", 0.174], ["S", 0.162], ["S", 0.126], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.265], ["A", 0.673], ["A", 0.927], ["A", 0.913], ["A", 0.816], ["A", 0.686], ["A", 0.525], ["A", 0.457], ["A", 0.365], ["S", 0.2], ["S", 0.131], ["E", 0.198], ["E", 0.189], ["E", 0.108], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "TOM", "text": "That's horrible.", "start": 10955, "end": 10990, "t0": 365.158, "t1": 366.34, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.328], ["A", 0.839], ["A", 0.949], ["A", 0.664], ["A", 0.269], ["S", 0.434], ["S", 0.798], ["S", 0.61], ["S", 0.267], ["S", 0.187], ["S", 0.246], ["S", 0.548], ["O", 0.867], ["O", 0.918], ["O", 0.779], ["O", 0.653], ["O", 0.567], ["O", 0.516], ["O", 0.42], ["O", 0.245], ["O", 0.175], ["O", 0.303], ["O", 0.34], ["O", 0.313], ["O", 0.301], ["O", 0.196], ["O", 0.107], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "BARBER", "text": "That's the point.", "start": 11000, "end": 11031, "t0": 366.66, "t1": 367.713, "vis": [["O", 0.154], ["E", 0.413], ["E", 0.819], ["E", 0.984], ["A", 0.983], ["A", 0.858], ["A", 0.536], ["A", 0.205], ["S", 0.109], ["S", 0.208], ["S", 0.29], ["S", 0.251], ["S", 0.123], ["S", 0.178], ["S", 0.377], ["S", 0.279], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.112], ["X", 0.254], ["O", 0.653], ["O", 0.918], ["O", 0.848], ["O", 0.595], ["E", 0.39], ["E", 0.316], ["O", 0.237], ["O", 0.127], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s37_openwide", "ch": 6, "start": 11037, "end": 11198, "lines": [{"sp": "BARBER", "text": "Now. Open wide.", "start": 11037, "end": 11080, "t0": 367.9, "t1": 369.327, "vis": [["O", 0.224], ["O", 0.596], ["O", 0.908], ["E", 0.995], ["E", 1.0], ["E", 0.973], ["E", 0.841], ["E", 0.624], ["E", 0.429], ["E", 0.275], ["A", 0.184], ["A", 0.115], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.47], ["E", 0.887], ["E", 0.902], ["E", 0.523], ["E", 0.156], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.167], ["X", 0.345], ["O", 0.45], ["O", 0.454], ["O", 0.454], ["O", 0.384], ["O", 0.406], ["A", 0.606], ["A", 0.645], ["A", 0.54], ["A", 0.396], ["E", 0.239], ["E", 0.149], ["E", 0.102], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "BARBER", "text": "This won't hurt...", "start": 11095, "end": 11133, "t0": 369.827, "t1": 371.107, "vis": [["O", 0.155], ["O", 0.412], ["E", 0.86], ["E", 0.98], ["E", 0.816], ["S", 0.465], ["S", 0.3], ["S", 0.252], ["S", 0.25], ["S", 0.188], ["O", 0.219], ["O", 0.293], ["A", 0.458], ["A", 0.83], ["A", 0.986], ["A", 0.961], ["A", 0.793], ["O", 0.573], ["O", 0.402], ["O", 0.253], ["O", 0.116], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.263], ["A", 0.566], ["A", 0.731], ["A", 0.608], ["A", 0.407], ["E", 0.214], ["E", 0.12], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "BARBER", "text": "much.", "start": 11172, "end": 11192, "t0": 372.407, "t1": 373.074, "vis": [["O", 0.284], ["O", 0.633], ["A", 0.889], ["A", 0.969], ["A", 0.994], ["A", 0.99], ["A", 0.934], ["A", 0.808], ["A", 0.633], ["A", 0.46], ["A", 0.245], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.118], ["S", 0.189], ["S", 0.187], ["S", 0.14], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s38_regret", "ch": 6, "start": 11198, "end": 11281, "lines": []}, {"id": "s39_pull", "ch": 6, "start": 11281, "end": 11471, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "He braces his knee against the chair. Rocks the tooth once.", "start": 11281, "end": 11403, "t0": 376.033, "t1": 380.103}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Twice.", "start": 11415, "end": 11439, "t0": 380.503, "t1": 381.289}]}, {"id": "s40_pop", "ch": 6, "start": 11471, "end": 11592, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "And it's out.", "start": 11555, "end": 11587, "t0": 385.167, "t1": 386.228}]}, {"id": "s41_trophy", "ch": 6, "start": 11592, "end": 11834, "lines": [{"sp": "BARBER", "text": "Ha! A beauty. That one goes in the window.", "start": 11592, "end": 11683, "t0": 386.4, "t1": 389.423, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.174], ["S", 0.393], ["S", 0.708], ["A", 0.945], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.978], ["A", 0.846], ["A", 0.583], ["A", 0.362], ["A", 0.188], ["X", 0.0], ["E", 0.145], ["E", 0.325], ["O", 0.325], ["O", 0.177], ["X", 0.0], ["S", 0.134], ["S", 0.323], ["S", 0.626], ["E", 0.809], ["E", 0.586], ["S", 0.301], ["S", 0.271], ["S", 0.296], ["E", 0.241], ["E", 0.231], ["E", 0.169], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.359], ["E", 0.849], ["E", 0.929], ["E", 0.606], ["E", 0.192], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.378], ["O", 0.743], ["O", 0.921], ["O", 0.876], ["O", 0.783], ["O", 0.699], ["O", 0.454], ["S", 0.367], ["S", 0.603], ["A", 0.915], ["A", 1.0], ["A", 0.946], ["A", 0.759], ["A", 0.601], ["O", 0.488], ["O", 0.421], ["O", 0.342], ["S", 0.271], ["S", 0.266], ["S", 0.315], ["A", 0.491], ["A", 0.568], ["O", 0.59], ["O", 0.512], ["O", 0.506], ["O", 0.455], ["O", 0.331], ["O", 0.405], ["A", 0.603], ["A", 0.672], ["O", 0.574], ["O", 0.444], ["O", 0.312], ["O", 0.233], ["E", 0.221], ["E", 0.199], ["E", 0.155], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}, {"sp": "N", "text": "It took about three seconds. You'll remember them for the rest of your life.", "start": 11692, "end": 11828, "t0": 389.743, "t1": 394.283}]}, {"id": "s42_generalbill", "ch": 7, "start": 11834, "end": 12234, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "In December, the city printed its bill for the whole year.", "start": 11834, "end": 11946, "t0": 394.467, "t1": 398.194}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Plague: sixty-eight thousand, five hundred and ninety-six deaths. Historians think the real number was closer to one hundred thousand.", "start": 11955, "end": 12228, "t0": 398.514, "t1": 407.607}]}, {"id": "s43_teethcount", "ch": 7, "start": 12234, "end": 12385, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "And under one short word, Teeth, two thousand, six hundred and fourteen.", "start": 12234, "end": 12380, "t0": 407.8, "t1": 412.655}]}, {"id": "s44_babies", "ch": 7, "start": 12385, "end": 12832, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "Many of them were probably babies who died while teething. The label hid a lot of guesswork.", "start": 12385, "end": 12575, "t0": 412.833, "t1": 419.152}, {"sp": "N", "text": "The causes were decided by searchers, usually poor old women, paid for each body, with no medical training at all.", "start": 12584, "end": 12826, "t0": 419.472, "t1": 427.537}]}, {"id": "s45_infection", "ch": 7, "start": 12832, "end": 13127, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "But some were people like you. A rotten tooth, an infection that spread into the jaw, then the blood. Before antibiotics, that could kill in days.", "start": 12832, "end": 13122, "t0": 427.733, "t1": 437.39}]}, {"id": "s46_verdict", "ch": 7, "start": 13127, "end": 13461, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "The barber's pliers were brutal. They could break a jaw, or leave an infection behind.", "start": 13127, "end": 13293, "t0": 437.567, "t1": 443.11}, {"sp": "N", "text": "But for a tooth like yours, they were the only cure in London that actually worked.", "start": 13303, "end": 13456, "t0": 443.43, "t1": 448.532}]}, {"id": "s46b_gap", "ch": 7, "start": 13461, "end": 13810, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "And the hole it left would stay a hole. No fillings, no crowns, no implants.", "start": 13461, "end": 13625, "t0": 448.7, "t1": 454.171}, {"sp": "N", "text": "If you were rich, you could buy false teeth carved from ivory or bone. You are not rich.", "start": 13635, "end": 13804, "t0": 454.491, "t1": 460.137}]}, {"id": "s47_recover", "ch": 8, "start": 13810, "end": 14060, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "The swelling goes down in a week. You go back to the ovens, chewing on the right side. By winter, the plague begins to fade.", "start": 13810, "end": 14055, "t0": 460.333, "t1": 468.498}]}, {"id": "s48_fire", "ch": 8, "start": 14060, "end": 14461, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "You survived the plague year, with one tooth fewer. Now you just have to survive the next one.", "start": 14060, "end": 14246, "t0": 468.667, "t1": 474.882}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Because in September, sixteen sixty-six, a fire will start in a baker's shop, on Pudding Lane.", "start": 14256, "end": 14456, "t0": 475.202, "t1": 481.858}]}, {"id": "s49_question", "ch": 8, "start": 14461, "end": 14812, "lines": [{"sp": "N", "text": "So, tell me. Clove oil, henbane smoke, or the barber's pliers?", "start": 14461, "end": 14598, "t0": 482.033, "t1": 486.585}, {"sp": "N", "text": "Would you have survived sixteen sixty-five?", "start": 14607, "end": 14700, "t0": 486.905, "t1": 490.006}, {"sp": "TOM", "text": "Never. Eating. Crust. Again.", "start": 14710, "end": 14782, "t0": 490.326, "t1": 492.739, "vis": [["X", 0.0], ["O", 0.26], ["O", 0.626], ["O", 0.927], ["A", 0.999], ["A", 0.994], ["A", 0.836], ["A", 0.512], ["A", 0.728], ["A", 0.946], ["A", 0.856], ["A", 0.478], ["O", 0.153], ["O", 0.128], ["A", 0.366], ["A", 0.616], ["A", 0.596], ["A", 0.338], ["A", 0.276], ["S", 0.581], ["S", 0.374], ["A", 0.376], ["A", 0.434], ["O", 0.445], ["O", 0.432], ["O", 0.357], ["O", 0.2], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.167], ["X", 0.221], ["X", 0.438], ["X", 0.867], ["X", 0.94], ["X", 0.654], ["X", 0.373], ["S", 0.628], ["S", 0.901], ["S", 0.73], ["S", 0.26], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.189], ["O", 0.214], ["O", 0.158], ["O", 0.319], ["A", 0.479], ["A", 0.46], ["A", 0.401], ["O", 0.372], ["O", 0.367], ["O", 0.322], ["O", 0.235], ["O", 0.112], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0], ["X", 0.0]]}]}, {"id": "s50_end", "ch": 8, "start": 14812, "end": 15177, "lines": []}], "chapters": {"1": "A Toothache in the Plague Year", "2": "Tom's London", "3": "The Worm", "4": "Kitchen Cures", "5": "Who Pulls Teeth in 1665?", "6": "The Barber-Surgeon", "7": "What Really Happened", "8": "The Next Year"}}